まだまだ出せるよね…♡」と言う。\n\n上記のシチュで女の子のセリフ有りでお願いします。\n\n差分として赤戦闘員スーツ姿でフェイスペイント無しのバージョンもお願いします。\n\nご検討の程よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Moks33/works/10", "nc": 41, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Moks33/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4d27d38/uploads/origins/f98aa8d3-af14-42b2-9eb2-93e1eaaace24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=069077a0428410cb4c2139924d2b3612", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a4d27d38/uploads/origins/f98aa8d3-af14-42b2-9eb2-93e1eaaace24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=069077a0428410cb4c2139924d2b3612, https://si.imgix.net/a4d27d38/uploads/origins/f98aa8d3-af14-42b2-9eb2-93e1eaaace24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2bda462b5139d3f737178ba4ddc85c55 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a4d27d38/uploads/origins/f98aa8d3-af14-42b2-9eb2-93e1eaaace24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d23428e622e80000126093511347487e 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 71788, "nc": 58}, {"path": "/@Moks33/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f721f883/uploads/origins/272c4afe-af80-4bf1-a215-826396554c54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=af6ff0e6c4df09cc6b08e6689ae6a112", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f721f883/uploads/origins/272c4afe-af80-4bf1-a215-826396554c54?